  {
    "hidden": false,
    "id": "li-med-m1",
    "nodeIds": [
      "li-open",
    ],
    "panelId": null,
    "redFlagId": null,
    "text": "Hi Ananya, I came across your profile and noticed your economics coursework and Excel-based project. We have an opening for a Business Research Intern at Nexora Technologies in Bengaluru (hybrid). The internship runs for three months and offers ₹18,000 per month. The role involves desk research, cleaning basic data in Excel and preparing short market summaries.

